WEBVTT

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:39.750
Well, look here. The Leaf 
is being paid a visit...

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:42.600
...by the Sand Village's Kazekage, Gaara.

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:46.200
Huh? Something about him 
seems off, though.

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:53.550
Do you folks out there in TV 
land see what's different?

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:55.650
What's with Gaara today?

00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:58.120
He hasn't said a word.

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:02.050
Wait, look, the character 
on his forehead!

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:03.720
It's not "love."

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.450
It changed to "romance!"

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:16.150
<b>Gaara's First Crush</b>

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:20.340
What's gotten into Gaara?

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:21.690
Maybe he's just changing his look?

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:23.870
Or maybe it's...

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:25.570
There's no maybe about it.

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:26.830
It couldn't be more obvious.

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:30.460
Gaara's got a crush on someone!

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:33.060
But on whom?

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:37.040
If he's here, it must be someone 
from our village, right?

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:39.050
Maybe Sakura?

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:41.810
If that's the case, he's now 
my rival in love, too.

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:43.800
And when you add Naruto,

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:46.220
we've got one messy love rectangle.

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:49.770
Oh no! What if the powers don't believe...

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:53.650
...a hot-blooded ninja gag 
anime can get popular,

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:57.500
and they're trying to change the
genre into a trendy love story?!

00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:00.400
<b>In the Name of Love - Tokyo Lovin' 101
A Summer's Tale</b>

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:02.910
<b>Episode 1
A Meeting and Reunion?</b>

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.580
<b>Kanchi</b>

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.200
<b>Sekiguchi</b>

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.200
<b>Mikami</b>

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:20.580
I never watch romantic dramas,
so I have no idea what to say!

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:23.220
If you'd just let me play a man for once!

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:30.290
They're late. What's taking so long?

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.680
Ah, this guy and his disguises again.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.400
Why are you dressed as Gaara?

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:38.740
Isn't it obvious?

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:43.460
Lee and his little pals have to tread
carefully around the Kazekage.

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:47.350
And the moment they leave themselves
open, I'll rip them to shreds!

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:48.450
Ah, I see.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.650
And since Gaara's naturally 
taciturn anyway,

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:53.460
there's nothing suspicious 
about you not talking.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.840
They've been gone a long time, though.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.580
What could they be doing?

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.130
Could they have seen 
through my disguise?!

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:04.090
<b>Gaara Love Assistance Planning HQ</b>

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:04.090
Well, if it's not Sakura...

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:06.340
Believe it or not, it could be Tenten.

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:07.680
Me?!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.980
Oh jeez, this is so sudden!

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.060
Or maybe Hinata?

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:17.270
O-Over my dead body!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.440
What about Lady Tsunade?

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:23.110
Pretty big age gap there...

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:25.740
Wait, I've got it!

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:29.290
I bet Gaara fell in love that other time!

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:30.160
Other time?

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:33.400
Remember the summer barbecue?

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:35.040
Oh, the one Guy Sensei did?

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:38.640
He must've thought Neji in 
drag was an actual girl,

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:41.180
and fell head over heels!

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:42.300
Me?!

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:43.780
Why Neji?!

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:47.650
Why would he fall for a guy in drag
over of a real girl like me?!

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:49.550
Look, this is the Kazekage.

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:54.210
If we're not careful, we'll end up causing 
an diplomatic crisis with the Hidden Sand village.

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:55.950
We need to tread carefully, 
and send Neji in.

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:57.510
What?

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:04.200
Go on, Nejie!

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:07.030
Um... L-Lord Gaara...

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:11.030
I-I know we don't know 
each other very well,

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:13.620
so let's try to be friends first, okay?

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:20.030
We'll start with some group dates!

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:23.210
Why are we here, too?

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:27.620
I guarantee you Gaara's 
never been on a date.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:31.390
There's much less pressure when you're
on a double date with friends.

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:33.930
Why do we even need a date?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.720
He should've just been honest 
with Gaara and turned him down.

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:39.550
No, a man's heart is very fragile.

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:43.210
A flat-out "no thanks" would crush him.

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.820
Then how do we get out of this?

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:48.860
Do you know why I picked this park?

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:51.400
Perhaps it's the curse 
of the lake's spirit,

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:54.420
or a jealous goddess green with envy.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.330
Either way, the lake is jinxed.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:59.020
Any couple who rides a boat across
it is guaranteed to break up!

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.180
And we're relying on this jinx?

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:03.030
Yes.

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:07.900
How did things end up like this?

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:15.080
He's got the wrong character 
on his forehead!

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:17.090
He just now noticed?

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.190
That's step one.

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.940
Next, we have a takoyaki snack!

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:25.400
Takoyaki?

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:27.520
Why?

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:31.220
So you get lots of seaweed 
stuck in your teeth,

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:32.610
in a hilarious manner.

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:34.190
Why?!

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:40.840
To make yourself unattractive so that
Gaara will initiate the breakup.

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.070
Don't do it...

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:44.250
I mean... please...

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:46.860
Get it all over your teeth!

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:50.040
And now the nose hairs!

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:53.300
Hang in there, Neji...

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:56.640
<i>Why me?</i>

00:06:57.690 --> 00:06:59.510
<i>What am I supposed to say?</i>

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:00.900
That's the spirit.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:04.380
Now seal the deal. Rip a huge fart!

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:05.740
On command?!

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:09.150
All right, I'll handle this one.

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.710
Nejie, you should be ashamed!

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:14.730
That's very unladylike!

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:16.880
Why? Why me?

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:19.160
<i>It's awful. The smell, and the acting.</i>

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:22.290
<i>I don't know how to react...</i>

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:26.390
<i>I didn't think very far ahead 
when I put on this getup,</i>

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:28.840
<i>I don't have a good 
grasp of his character.</i>

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:32.000
<i>How would he react?</i>

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:33.350
Lord Orochimaru.

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:34.180
Kabuto?

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:36.580
You put the wrong character 
on your forehead,

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:38.570
and they misinterpreted it.

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:39.890
It's wrong?

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:42.310
Let's go, Gaara.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:43.690
Um, I...

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:45.370
What character was it again?

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:46.980
Oh... uh...

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:50.420
"Odd?"

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:52.720
It's not "romance" anymore?

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:54.490
That means...

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:56.000
Okay, don't move!

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:56.940
Wh-What?

00:07:58.230 --> 00:07:59.520
Odd-Ball.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.080
Please, no more...

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:04.290
Lord Orochimaru, it's still wrong!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.210
It is?

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.880
If it's not "romance" or "odd," then...

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:20.580
<b>Forget</b>

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:12.770
This is no time for a memory lapse!

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:14.090
That's way too far off!

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:15.700
The first one was closer!

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:17.840
You know, not romance, but deeper!

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:20.600
Deeper, you say?

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:24.050
I didn't mean "fish!"

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:26.950
What are you, the menu 
at a sushi joint?

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.770
Specifically, that's "tuna."

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:30.980
Got a craving for tuna?

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:34.080
We should get sushi afterwards.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.090
Your treat, Gaara!

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.890
Kabuto!

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:40.930
Come on, don't make me say it!

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:43.630
It's that feeling. It makes
your heart pound...

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:46.210
Desire that makes your heart pound...

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:47.460
<b>Sex</b>

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:48.650
Sex?!

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:49.870
Sex now?!

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:52.070
Like the Sexy Jutsu?

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:55.510
Wow, on the first date?!

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:57.800
Please, anything but that...

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:00.140
No turning back now, Neji!

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.040
N-No...

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.400
No!

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:05.890
Sexy Jutsu!

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:14.620
You getting excited doesn't help me!

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.810
I-It's not sex.

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:19.510
It's more important, 
more dear to the heart!

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:22.290
Important? Dear?

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:23.870
<b>Grandchild</b>

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.900
Grandkids?!

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:27.850
You're not even married yet.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:28.790
Wrong again?

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:33.130
That's much sweeter, but it's 
still the wrong character.

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:35.130
Here we are!

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:37.090
So cute!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.920
How about this one?

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:42.060
Here, hold him.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:46.020
<i>I'm in hell.</i>

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.480
Don't try this at home, kids.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:52.360
Hey, maybe this means the 
plan is working, in a sense.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:55.570
Those idiots are doing whatever
Lord Orochimaru's forehead says.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:56.980
Now's our chance.

00:09:56.980 --> 00:10:00.070
<i>Indeed, I'll use my forehead 
to control Lee and...</i>

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:01.920
<i>...his pals like puppets on a string!</i>

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:05.560
<i>My true goal is to rip Lee to shreds.</i>

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:07.410
<i>Then I'll pound Naruto to a pulp,</i>

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:10.800
<i>and maybe turn that Sakura 
girl into my servant.</i>

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:13.660
<i>After that I'll shave the 
heads on Mount Hokage,</i>

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:17.800
<i>conquer the Hidden Leaf and 
turn it into the Hidden Snake!</i>

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:25.810
<i>Now how do I express all 
that in a single character?</i>

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:35.030
It's utterly impossible!

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:39.200
Lord Orochimaru, I've got an idea.

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:41.750
Don't you love our grandkids, Grandma?

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:43.700
Sure do, Grampy.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:44.930
No more grandkids!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.160
This is my true heart's desire!

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:53.380
It's some kind of encoded cipher text!

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.870
We have to decipher it.

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:56.660
Neji!

00:10:57.950 --> 00:10:59.050
Byakugan!

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:04.700
My true goal is to rip Lee to shreds.

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:06.260
Then I'll pound Naruto to a pulp,

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:09.130
and maybe turn that Sakura 
girl into my servant.

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:11.030
After that I'll shave the 
heads on Mount Hokage,

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:13.910
conquer the Hidden Leaf and 
turn it into the Hidden Snake!

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:21.410
You're Orochimaru, aren't you?

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:24.170
O-Oh no!

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:26.080
Retreat!

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:34.390
Thank God...

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:36.920
There's no substitute for "love!"

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:46.430
Our story begins with a wrapped present.

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:52.740
Another beautiful morning!

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:58.700
What's this?

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:01.650
To Lee, from Sakura Haruno.

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:07.880
A p-present from Sakura?!

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:13.720
Lee has yet to realize this will be the
beginning of a terrible catastrophe.

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:24.090
<b>A Gift From Orochimaru</b>

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:26.600
This is...

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:31.060
The latest model training gauge!

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.200
This is an amazing piece of technology!

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:35.030
Just wear it while you 
train, and afterwards,

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:38.040
it tells you how much you've improved!

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:40.850
Sakura has such amazing taste!

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.450
Lee, let's train together!

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.410
Okay, Sakura!

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:49.730
You're good, Sakura, but I won't lose!

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:56.540
Death/Life

00:12:55.940 --> 00:13:00.430
It's like Sakura's watching me. 
I'll be unstoppable now!

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:01.790
Hey, Bushy-Brows!

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:02.800
Training hard again today?

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.650
Thank you so much, Sakura.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:08.000
I'm already putting your gift to good use!

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:09.650
Gift? What gift?

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:11.370
She's never given me any presents!

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:14.230
There's no way you'd get one first!

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.810
W-Wait, then who...?

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.150
Me.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:22.500
Orochimaru! You again?!

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:23.790
Uh oh, you'd better not stop.

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:27.120
It'll be bad for your health 
if you stop training now.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:28.990
Wh-What're you talking about?

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:32.950
That gauge is rigged to explode 
if you stop training.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:34.000
Explode?!

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:44.240
Death/Life

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:37.430
You sealed your fate when 
you began working out.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:39.440
The moment you stop, it will blow!

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:42.120
Try to take it off, it will blow.

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:46.810
In other words, you'll have to 
keep training until you die!

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:47.450
RIP Lee

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:49.180
Wh-What?!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.090
You love to train so much,

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:53.310
it's only natural you die doing it.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:56.980
Oh no...

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:59.810
Don't stop! Keep exercising!

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:01.650
Let's get help!

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:02.500
Right!

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.110
He planted a bomb on Lee?

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:09.600
What's with the sunglasses?

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:12.730
These? They're a present from Tenten.

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:16.770
Huh? I didn't get you any presents.

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:18.540
What's with that hat?

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:21.540
You got it for me, remember?

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:24.450
Why would I get you something like that?

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:25.710
Then who...?

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:29.210
They're both from me!

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:30.260
Him again?

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:34.350
That hat's really a bomb rigged
with chakra that reacts to punchlines.

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:37.090
Chakra that reacts to punchlines?

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:38.430
Overreact to any jokes,

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:41.010
and it'll trigger the explosive tag inside.

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:45.720
Of course, if you try to take it off, 
it'll blow as well, be careful!

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:47.460
What kinda chakra is that?

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:48.570
Forget the chak―

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.400
Don't! If you say a 
punchline, you'll blow up!

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.240
He got Tenten, too...

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:55.090
Tenten's punchlines have been sealed.

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:56.060
No way...

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:57.500
Then these sunglasses―

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:00.750
A bomb rigged with chakra that 
reacts to cross-dressing.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.750
C-Cross-dressing chakra?!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.090
Chakra can do anything, huh.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:07.210
Slip into a dress, or 
try to take them off,

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.790
and the explosive tags will ignite.

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:11.190
Not Neji's cross-dressing, too!

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:14.350
It doesn't matter if I can't cross-dress!

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.840
We'll see about that.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:20.480
The two of you and Lee will 
all be blasted to bits!

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.540
That monster.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:29.340
How dare he keep Neji 
from cross-dressing?

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:30.980
Or Tenten from overreacting?

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:31.700
What do we do now?

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:35.950
Forget them. Your body giving out
is the most pressing concern.

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:37.890
Don't worry about me.

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:40.790
At this rate I can train 
for a week straight.

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:45.920
Forget it, even if you can handle it,

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.800
just watching you is 
making us exhausted!

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:52.110
We'll just have to keep Lee out 
of the shot as much as possible.

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:53.970
Mr. Cameraman!

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:57.970
Next I'll do 10,000 pull-ups!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:01.480
Now's our chance. Let's think 
of a way to defuse the bomb.

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:06.490
How can we do that when Lee's 
flying all over the place?

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.120
The bomb will blow if he stops training,

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:11.990
but there are different ways to train.

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:13.620
That's true.

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:16.640
He doesn't necessarily have 
to wear himself out like―

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:18.830
Shut up!

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:21.620
Sorry, I'll train quietly.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:24.550
Yeah, and there are ways to 
train while staying still.

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:26.000
Like flower arrangement.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.220
Perfect!

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:30.120
Flower arrangement will 
conserve Lee's stamina,

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:32.470
and give us a shot at defusing the bomb.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.250
It's no use!

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.700
One, two, one, two, one, two!

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:51.550
Shoot!

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:54.340
Okay, what if he pops this bubble wrap?

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:55.280
How is that training?!

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:07.780
It's no use!

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:09.600
One, two, one, two, one, two!

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:10.950
How about this?

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:11.820
What's that?

00:17:11.820 --> 00:17:14.530
He can lick this jawbreaker until it's 
completely gone, without biting!

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:15.830
That's so boring!

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:29.740
It's no use!

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:31.030
Well, duh!

00:17:34.550 --> 00:17:35.610
She's mad.

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:38.410
I bet she wanted to deliver 
the punchline herself.

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:41.440
N-No, it doesn't bother me.

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:45.870
It's just, Neji's delivery was a little... weak.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.410
Y-You think I'm not a good straight man?

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:54.030
Well, it definitely needed 
a little more punch.

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:55.840
And you normally set up the jokes.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.150
I do?!

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.280
I'm innately a stooge?!

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:02.020
Don't get so down...

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:07.730
All right, how about I handle the
punchlines in Tenten's place?

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:08.730
Mr. Narrator?

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.520
Don't worry, I may not look it,

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.570
but I was part of a 
stand-up comedy team once.

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:15.400
Punchlines were my specialty.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.780
Really? I never would've guessed!

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:21.190
Yes, it was about twenty years ago.

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:25.470
We performed under the 
name "Caltrop & Trip,"

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:27.620
and were the best in the 
world at what we did.

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:34.960
But fame is fleeting, and eventually
the boom died and we couldn't get work.

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:37.590
So, we went our separate ways.

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:41.460
My set-up man found 
success as a solo act,

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:43.030
and myself...

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.020
I quit show business and tried...

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:48.320
...opening up a Korean 
barbecue in Shinbashi,

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:49.440
but it didn't work out.

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:52.820
Then I tried running a bed and 
breakfast in Okinawa, but that failed, too.

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:55.400
And finally I took this narrator 
job, and now I find myself―

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:58.400
You're supposed to deliver
the punchlines, not spout―

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.840
Whoa, stop!

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:03.870
Lee, the bomb!

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:05.290
R-Right!

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:09.760
Get serious! Was any 
of that even true?

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:13.460
I'm so sorry. I got carried away 
and started making things up...

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:16.490
We need to defuse Bushy-Brows' 
bomb, and fast.

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:17.920
But how?

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.510
You can do it, Neji.

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.510
Remember that movie we all 
watched the other day?

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:24.510
"Charleston's Angels," where 
the three beautiful spies...

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:28.240
...defused a bomb in Area 51 and 
saved the world from destruction?

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:30.850
<b>Charleston's 
Angels</b>

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:30.850
Oh yeah, do it like the movie!

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:37.120
The red explosive tag, 
or the blue one...

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:38.110
Which do I pull?

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.490
Wait, I can't cross-dress!

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:43.220
Then what about that 
anime we were watching?

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:46.210
You know, where the supermodel 
idol unit stumbles...

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:48.870
...upon a bomb in a space 
station's bathroom?

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:51.620
Oh, like in that one anime.

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:57.310
The red explosive tag, 
or the blue one...

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:58.790
And so on.

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:00.510
What'd I just say?

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:03.080
I can't cross-dress or I'll blow up!

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:05.230
What're we gonna do?!

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:06.700
We're screwed.

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:13.400
Maybe you could defuse the 
bomb without cross-dressing?

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:16.930
Or wouldn't it be faster 
to just use your...

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:20.270
...Byakugan to figure out how 
to dismantle the bomb?

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:21.530
I-I guess so...

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:23.570
I'm counting on you, Neji.

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:25.030
Byakugan!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.540
It's no good, the 
sunglasses are too dark!

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.000
There's no point in seeing 
clearly if you blow up!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.520
Tenten, no punchlines!

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:38.380
They're gonna blow!

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.960
I'm so stupid!

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:45.530
Gotcha!

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:48.530
Lee and his ninja pals will 
be blown to smithereens!

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:51.930
Huh?

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:55.440
Lord Orochimaru!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:58.370
I got my hands on a ton 
of explosive tags!

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:01.210
Now we can finish the bombs!

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:03.680
W-Wait a second...

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:07.620
Then the bombs were never inside 
the gifts in the first place?

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:15.690
That's right. Why do you ask?

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:37.450
Lee, Neji, and Tenten 
exploded with anger,

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:40.620
and they rigged the pair with 
a bomb that will explode...

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:43.250
...the moment he thinks of 
another stupid plan.

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:25.030
Next week is "The Green 
Flame, Dodge Lee!"

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:27.840
<b>The Green Flame, Dodge Lee
The Yes-Man Says No</b>

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:27.840
and "The Yes-Man Says No!"

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:31.130
Apparently we're playing 
a bunch of ball games!

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:34.760
I'll just make a bunch of clones 
and win with superior numbers!

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:37.920
Neji will knock them all 
away with his Air Palm!

00:23:37.920 --> 00:23:39.950
Not if I use the Rasengan, too!

00:23:39.950 --> 00:23:45.020
Tenten will summon a bunch of weapons
and knock them all away, and we'll win!

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:48.970
It's a ball game, not a ninjutsu battle!
